                "text": "In September, I introduced or cosponsored a number of bills to protect health and build wealth:\n\n&gt;The Parent PLUS Parity Act\n&gt; The Uterine Cancer Study Act\n&gt; The College Thriving Act\n&gt; The Industrial Agriculture Conversion Act\n\nDemocrats are putting #PeopleOverPolitics. https://t.co/WILuCkLDTs",
