                "text": "I was honored to speak at the #BlackHealthMatters Health Expo & Summit this past weekend.\n\nAs MLK once said, \u201cOf all the forms of inequality, injustice in health care is the most shocking and inhumane.\u201d\n\nOur fight for quality, affordable healthcare for all continues. https://t.co/FQiInt5rjh",
